<Base title="Privacy Policy | Sundays with Anna" description="How Sundays with Anna collects, uses and protects your information.">
<section class="p" style="padding-top:56px;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto"><div class="up" style="color:#8A8A8A">Sundays with Anna</div><h1 class="hd" style="margin:10px 0 8px;font-size:84px;line-height:.95">Privacy policy</h1><div class="hand" style="font-size:34px;transform:rotate(-2deg)">your data, plainly</div></section>
<section class="p" style="padding-top:40px;padding-bottom:40px"><div class="art-body" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto">
<p><em>Last updated: October 25, 2026</em></p>
<p>This policy explains what information Sundays with Anna (“I”, “me”, “this site”) collects when you visit, and what I do with it. I try to collect as little as possible.</p>
<h2>Information I collect</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Email address</strong>, if you subscribe to the Sunday letter. I use it only to send you the letter and related updates.</li>
<li><strong>Usage data</strong>, such as pages visited, device type and approximate location, collected through analytics tools once they are enabled on this site.</li>
<li><strong>Messages</strong> you send me by email or social media.</li>
</ul>
<h2>How I use it</h2>
<ul>
<li>To send the Sunday letter and reply to your messages.</li>
<li>To understand which notes and reviews are useful, and to improve the site.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Email service</h2>
<p>If you subscribe, your email address is processed by an email service provider on my behalf. Every email includes an unsubscribe link, and you can unsubscribe at any time.</p>
<h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
<p>This site may use cookies or similar technologies for basic analytics and to remember preferences. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings.</p>
<h2>Affiliate links</h2>
<p>Some links may be affiliate links. When you click one, the retailer may set its own cookies. See my <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
<h2>Sharing</h2>
<p>I do not sell your personal information. I share it only with service providers who help me run the site and the letter, or when the law requires it.</p>
<h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
<p>You can ask me to access, correct or delete the personal information I hold about you, and you can unsubscribe at any time. Depending on where you live (for example California), you may have additional privacy rights. To make a request, use the details on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
<h2>Children</h2>
<p>This site is not directed at children under 13, and I do not knowingly collect their information.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>I may update this policy and will change the date above when I do.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions? See the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</div></section>
</Base>
